		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Shed-sized bulbous plant with fanged mouths on tendrils, barbed vines, and broad leaves.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite (1d12 + swallow), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -4, <strong>W</strong> -3, <strong>Ch</strong> -4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Engulf</strong>. On a natural attack roll of 20, target is swallowed. Total darkness inside and 1d10 damage per round. Flytrap regurgitates all swallowed if dealt at least 10 damage in one round to the inside of its gullet.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
